@startuml 005-before
' D 도메인 메뉴 연결 리팩토링 전 (refactor/44-b-application b543703, #45)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "ui (D)" {
  class GameMenu <<final, static>> {
    + {static} install(BoardPanel, GameController, Clock)
    ~ {static} go(Clock, name : String)
    ~ {static} onTick(GameController)
    - {static} menuIsActive() : boolean
    - {static} load(GameController)
    - {static} store(GameController)
  }
  class FileDialogs <<static>> {
    + {static} userSelected(startHere, extension, description, selectButtonText) : File
  }
  class BoardPanel
  class LifeFrame
}

package "com.holub.ui" {
  class MenuSite <<static>> {
    + {static} addLine(requester, menu, name, ActionListener)
  }
}

package "application (B)" {
  class Clock
  class GameController
  enum Speed
}

package "javax.swing" {
  class JOptionPane
}

LifeFrame --> GameMenu : install()
GameMenu ..> MenuSite : addLine x10
GameMenu ..> FileDialogs : userSelected()
GameMenu ..> JOptionPane : showMessageDialog()
GameMenu ..> Clock : go(): name switch
GameMenu ..> Speed
GameMenu ..> GameController
GameMenu ..> BoardPanel : requester

note right of GameMenu
  Go 6항목이 리스너 하나를 공유하고
  getName() 문자열 switch로 분기.
  Exit는 System.exit(0) 직접 호출.
end note
@enduml
